---
import CollectibleViewer from './CollectibleViewer.astro';
---

<section
  class="minecraft-skin"
  aria-labelledby="minecraft-skin-title"
  data-minecraft-skin
>
  <div class="skin-model">
    <span class="skin-coordinate" aria-hidden="true">ULP / PLAYER_01</span
    ><CollectibleViewer kind="skin" label="Skin oficial" />
  </div>
  <div class="skin-copy">
    <span class="design-eyebrow">EL EQUIPO, TAMBIÉN EN MINECRAFT</span>
    <h2 id="minecraft-skin-title">Ponte la <em>skin de la ULP.</em></h2>
    <p>Descarga nuestra skin oficial y llévala a tu próxima partida.</p>
    <div class="skin-specs">
      <span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> 64 × 64 px</span><span
        >Modelo clásico</span
      ><span>PNG original</span>
    </div>
    <a
      class="design-button"
      href="/assets/activities/minecraft/ulp-skin.png"
      download="ULP-skin-minecraft.png"
      data-skin-download
      >Descargar skin <svg
        width="17"
        height="17"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.7"
        aria-hidden="true"
        ><path d="M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M5 16v5h14v-5"></path></svg
      ></a
    >
    <details>
      <summary>Cómo usarla <span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></summary><p>
        En el launcher de Minecraft Java, abre <strong
          >Aspectos → Nuevo aspecto</strong
        >, elige el modelo <strong>Clásico</strong> y carga el PNG. Después pulsa
        <strong>Guardar y usar</strong>. <a
          href="https://www.minecraft.net/es-es/article/what-is-minecraft-skin"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">Guía oficial de Minecraft ↗</a
        >
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .minecraft-skin {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(25px, 5vw, 65px);
    align-items: center;
    padding: 24px 32px;
    margin-block: 32px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--surface);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .skin-model {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, #88b5a32e, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 14px;
  }
  .skin-coordinate {
    position: absolute;
    left: 12px;
    bottom: 12px;
    font:
      8px ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted);
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .design-eyebrow {
    font-size: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(27px, 3.3vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 13px;
  }
  h2 em {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .skin-copy > p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 420px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .skin-specs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 16px;
    margin-block: 18px;
    font:
      9px ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .skin-specs > span {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .skin-specs i {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: #31a88b;
  }
  .design-button {
    font-size: 12px;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 11px 17px;
    gap: 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  details {
    margin-top: 13px;
    max-width: 420px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  summary {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    padding-block: 9px;
    max-width: 180px;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  details p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    padding-top: 6px;
  }
  details a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .minecraft-skin {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 16px 18px 22px;
      margin-block: 24px;
    }
    .skin-copy > p {
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
    }
    .skin-specs {
      margin-block: 14px;
    }
    .design-eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }
    .skin-coordinate {
      font-size: 7px;
    }
  }
</style>
